# Cursor Rules for SmartShopping

Please refer to the project constitution at:
- **AGENTS.md** (Single Source of Truth)
- **.agents/rules/** (Domain-specific architectural rules)

## Key Guidelines:
- Dual Layout: Every UI update must support both Mobile PWA and Desktop layouts.
- State: Never query Supabase directly in components; use Zustand Store + Services.
- Security: All database tables must have strict RLS scoped to `public.get_user_household_ids(auth.uid())`.
- Quality: Strict TypeScript (no `any`), run `npm run test`, `npm run lint`, and `npx tsc -b`.
